        <mxCell id="74" value="&lt;b&gt;Network design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Control plane and worker nodes use separate subnets.&lt;br&gt;• Subnets should be at least /27; validate non-overlapping VNet, pod, and service ranges.&lt;br&gt;• Public/private API and ingress visibility are independent choices.&lt;br&gt;• OVN-Kubernetes provides the cluster overlay and network policy enforcement." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#D6A800;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#323130;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="925" width="630" height="105" as="geometry" />
